error[E0107]: [CGP-E034] `CanRead` is a consumer trait and cannot bound an inner provider; a higher-order provider imports its provider trait `Reader`
  --> src/main.rs:24:23
   |
24 | #[use_provider(Inner: CanRead<'a, Source>)]
   |                       ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name the provider trait in the bound, idiomatically `#[use_provider(… : Reader<'a, Source>)]` (not the consumer trait `CanRead`)

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0107`.
